    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Fray is a <strong>turn-based</strong> strategy <strong>roguelite</strong>. Combat takes place on a procedurally generated hex based flying islands. You will use your units to outmaneuver and kill enemy troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Defeat Powerful Bosses</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple bosses with unique mechanics. Will you be able to outsmart them? Or maybe build a perfect team to defeat them? Possibilities are endless but one is sure... It WON'T be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Build Your Team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each combat you will get a different reward, making you choose next primal to join your team. This means that you will be making your team on the fly, having to improvise and work with what RNG gives you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Use Hundreds Of Abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit has 4 different abilities in its arsenal with varying degree of strength and utility. The abilities either cost or produce mana, forcing you to manage this resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primals may use those abilities to deal damage, shield allies, walk, fly, teleport, generate or exchange mana and even manipulate the battleground itself by creating or destroying hexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose Your Way</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to make difficult choices, deciding between adding a new primal to a roster, getting an enchantment, a team heal, currency or visiting a merchant. Plan your way through the Rift and make the most out of the choices given to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Recruit New Heroes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple heroes. Use their unique talents to conquer the Rift and learn more about their stories entangled with dark and ominous Ironclad Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Local PvP</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Fray offers a local PVP hot seat mode, where players can engage in strategic turn-based battles on custom maps with drafted teams. For those looking for high-level competition, we\u2019ve included features like drafting and a chess timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Fray is a <strong>turn-based</strong> strategy <strong>roguelite</strong>. Combat takes place on a procedurally generated hex based flying islands. You will use your units to outmaneuver and kill enemy troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bcefc06b00b006e6a8266abb5569c9b7.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Defeat Powerful Bosses</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple bosses with unique mechanics. Will you be able to outsmart them? Or maybe build a perfect team to defeat them? Possibilities are endless but one is sure... It WON'T be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/560e59b54a888981cab775893e40315f.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Build Your Team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each combat you will get a different reward, making you choose next primal to join your team. This means that you will be making your team on the fly, having to improvise and work with what RNG gives you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/62d929b95de29c14434238845735222b.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Use Hundreds Of Abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit has 4 different abilities in its arsenal with varying degree of strength and utility. The abilities either cost or produce mana, forcing you to manage this resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primals may use those abilities to deal damage, shield allies, walk, fly, teleport, generate or exchange mana and even manipulate the battleground itself by creating or destroying hexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/70d3ed8c2de6709b595e3d2e8fc01043.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose Your Way</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to make difficult choices, deciding between adding a new primal to a roster, getting an enchantment, a team heal, currency or visiting a merchant. Plan your way through the Rift and make the most out of the choices given to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/bee250d4997f1268f387e3f1a2484eca.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Recruit New Heroes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple heroes. Use their unique talents to conquer the Rift and learn more about their stories entangled with dark and ominous Ironclad Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/10a814269a6eb622d87d52732c1c95ef.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Local PvP</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Fray offers a local PVP hot seat mode, where players can engage in strategic turn-based battles on custom maps with drafted teams. For those looking for high-level competition, we\u2019ve included features like drafting and a chess timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.poster.avif?t=1754907617\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.webm?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/323685da8b95676aa7969981e751c07a.mp4?t=1754907617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357350/extras/da0f3347a2b52e26e08c1187387b4266.webp?t=1754907617\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Primal Fray is a turn-based strategy roguelite. Enter the Rift and fight your way through enemies while building a team of primals and collecting buffs along the way. Outmaneuver your foes and surprise them with powerful combos of a well-built and synergistic team to learn the truth about the Rift.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Czech, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
